WEBVTT

00:10:29.829 --> 00:10:34.968
But you have seen that redemption
in ways that I think has been

00:10:34.992 --> 00:10:36.529
so extraordinary.

00:10:36.553 --> 00:10:38.428
JL: A few short years ago,

00:10:38.452 --> 00:10:41.767
one of the members of the Klan

00:10:41.791 --> 00:10:46.235
who beat me and beat my seatmate,

00:10:46.259 --> 00:10:47.648
in a little town

00:10:48.755 --> 00:10:51.587
called Rock Hill, South Carolina,

00:10:52.483 --> 00:10:55.086
left us lying in a pool of blood ...

00:10:56.138 --> 00:10:57.808
Many years later,

00:10:57.832 --> 00:11:00.527
one member of the Klan